              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "When someone is ready to go further than a meal and a conversation, our peers become their case managers. This is the long game: sustained, individualized support, advocacy, coordination and follow-through toward goals the person has set for themselves."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "There’s no waiting list and no program to fit into. We ask what this person needs to move forward, and then we help make it happen."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Case management can look like:"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
